<title>USA: EMCOR to redeem portion of notes.</title>
<headline>EMCOR to redeem portion of notes.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMCOR Group Inc is redeeming about $11 million in principal of its 11 percent series C notes due 2001.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement on Friday that the redemption is for about 15 percent of the total outstanding principal of the notes.</p>
<p>The redemption price will be 105 percent of the principal amount of the series C notes redeemed.</p>
</text>
